% 控制台用户受影响，已发邮件通知，正和 Anthropic、OpenAI、谷歌一起处理。据 X 热点汇总，有用户被盗刷大额费用。","post":{"id":"2111519637049319818","url":"https://x.com/opencode/status/2111519637049319818","author":"opencode","author_name":"OpenCode","created_at":"2026-10-18T02:08+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":2594420,"likes":10992,"reposts":1407,"replies":685},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2111504421448257665","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111504421448257665"}},{"title":"谷歌 Gemini 4 Argon 和 Claude 比写代码","summary":"一张对比图让网友惊呼「Gemini 怎么突然领先 Claude 这么多」。据 X 热点汇总，谷歌 10 月 13 日开放这个模型给开发者，评价两极：有人说代码好维护，有人说失望。","post":{"id":"2111797472351916229","url":"https://x.com/SeHozaifa/status/2111797472351916229","author":"SeHozaifa","author_name":"Se Hozaifa","created_at":"2026-10-18T20:32+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":652522,"likes":3108,"reposts":43,"replies":281},"flag":"有争议","story":{"id":"2111832733844385988","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111832733844385988"}},{"title":"Anthropic 向美国国会递交 AI 安全法案草稿","summary":"据美国媒体 POLITICO，Anthropic 私下向议员推一份法案：只有当某个 AI 模型可能造成超过 10 亿美元损失、或伤亡 50 人以上时，政府才能叫停它发布。","post":{"id":"2111799253920256160","url":"https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2111799253920256160","author":"unusual_whales","author_name":"unusual_whales","created_at":"2026-10-18T20:39+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":271300,"likes":1226,"reposts":96,"replies":215},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2111801627355013163","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111801627355013163"}},{"title":"OpenAI 接口里冒出三个神秘「极光」模型","summary":"有人发现 OpenAI 接口列表里短暂出现三个叫 aurora 的测试模型。据 X 热点汇总，试用后发现它们是画图模型，不是大家期待的新聊天模型。","post":{"id":"2111656899338973391","url":"https://x.com/AndrewCurran_/status/2111656899338973391","author":"AndrewCurran_","author_name":"Andrew Curran","created_at":"2026-10-18T11:13+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":170194,"likes":2415,"reposts":83,"replies":181},"flag":"未证实","story":{"id":"2111667716293587199","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111667716293587199"}}]},{"id":"ai_money","name":"AI 赚钱思路/副业案例","icon":"💡","items":[{"title":"有人反驳：AI 算力租赁公司背后有巨头撑腰","summary":"有人列举：英伟达持有 CoreWeave 约一成股份，并承诺到 2032 年买下闲置算力；微软、谷歌、亚马逊也给其他算力公司担保或预付。他认为说这些公司会违约是看错了。","post":{"id":"2111856652685123781","url":"https://x.com/BoringBiz_/status/2111856652685123781","author":"BoringBiz_","author_name":"Boring_Business","created_at":"2026-10-19T00:27+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":70765,"likes":840,"reposts":59,"replies":71},"flag":"观点"},{"title":"英国《金融时报》：美国 AI 数据中心热潮出现裂缝","summary":"经济学家埃里安转引《金融时报》：美国靠借钱撑起的 AI 基建热潮，正遇到项目延期、居民反对、投资人信心动摇等问题。","post":{"id":"2111836895713906770","url":"https://x.com/elerianm/status/2111836895713906770","author":"elerianm","author_name":"Mohamed A. El-Erian","created_at":"2026-10-18T23:08+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":70629,"likes":956,"reposts":237,"replies":87},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2111954927555915827","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111954927555915827"}},{"title":"独立开发者：粉丝数是 X 上最被高估的数字","summary":"一位独立开发者说，同行粉丝比他多 70 倍，他赚得反而多 5 倍；他的客户只有千分之一来自 X。他认为「先涨粉再卖东西」是最慢的赚钱方式。","post":{"id":"2111781971345244645","url":"https://x.com/RobbyFrank/status/2111781971345244645","author":"RobbyFrank","author_name":"Robby Frank","created_at":"2026-10-18T19:30+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":41897,"likes":566,"reposts":14,"replies":178},"flag":"个人分享"},{"title":"Anthropic 收入增速明显放缓，投资人紧张","summary":"一位分析人士算账说，Anthropic 以前每月新增约 100 亿美元年化收入，现在只剩约 20 到 30 亿，是真放缓，所以 AI 股票下跌并不奇怪。","post":{"id":"2111862934460826052","url":"https://x.com/SouthernValue95/status/2111862934460826052","author":"SouthernValue95","author_name":"SouthernValue","created_at":"2026-10-19T00:52+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":29675,"likes":267,"reposts":16,"replies":27},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2111923830600167453","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111923830600167453"}},{"title":".si 域名被炒热，两笔卖出 13.4 万美元","summary":"据 X 热点汇总，美国政府把「人工智能」改叫「超级智能 SI」后，.si 结尾的域名被抢。域名圈账号晒出两笔成交共 13.4 万美元。这是炒作行情，跟风有风险。","post":{"id":"2111670722909409442","url":"https://x.com/wefollowsi/status/2111670722909409442","author":"wefollowsi","author_name":"Follow.SI","created_at":"2026-10-18T12:08+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1264,"likes":52,"reposts":5,"replies":7},"flag":"个人晒单","story":{"id":"2111756741956227303","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111756741956227303"}}]},{"id":"grok","name":"Grok Bot 使用小技巧","icon":"🛠️","items":[{"title":"让 Grok Bot 帮你网购：一句话比价下单","summary":"网友发一句话让 Grok Bot 买静音篮球，它自己比价、下单，32.91 美元包邮。马斯克说付款最省事是发信用卡截图，也可以填安全保险箱。卡号给出去要自己掂量。","post":{"id":"2111639287368462417","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2111639287368462417","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-18T10:03+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":2629213,"likes":8959,"reposts":1062,"replies":1013},"flag":"本人说法"},{"title":"Grok Bot 大更新：电脑操作快 3 倍","summary":"马斯克转发更新清单：电脑任务快 3 倍、回复时间减半、语音通话更快记性更好、能读 X 私信、在 X 上 @bot 就能派活、新增 Robinhood、Coinbase、Trello 等连接。","post":{"id":"2111642949071364231","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2111642949071364231","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-18T10:18+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":2427711,"likes":8657,"reposts":983,"replies":1344}},{"title":"用 Grok 加 Grok Bot 自己做了个剪辑软件","summary":"一位用了 25 年 Adobe Premiere 剪辑软件的网友说，用 Grok 和 Grok Bot 花 3 到 4 天做出自己的视频剪辑器，还打算免费公开源代码。马斯克点了爱心转发。","post":{"id":"2111637490050191644","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2111637490050191644","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-18T09:56+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1454188,"likes":9793,"reposts":965,"replies":639},"flag":"个人分享"},{"title":"Grok Bot 能打电话帮你订餐厅","summary":"网友做了个免费模板：说「今晚 7 点 4 个人订某餐厅」，它自己找电话、问清名字和回电号码、复述一遍等你同意才拨，打完告诉你结果，还能加进日历。","post":{"id":"2111867437238853726","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2111867437238853726","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-19T01:10+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1210982,"likes":6983,"reposts":858,"replies":1423},"flag":"个人分享","story":{"id":"2111873270651945389","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111873270651945389"}},{"title":"一句话讲清 Grok 和 Grok Bot 的区别","summary":"一位爸爸给新手开课：Grok 是聊天框，你问它答，关掉就停；Grok Bot 有自己的电脑，能开网页、读邮件、填表，你放下手机它还在干活，重要的事会先问你。","post":{"id":"2111838557329326421","url":"https://x.com/Texas_Twins_Dad/status/2111838557329326421","author":"Texas_Twins_Dad","author_name":"Texas Twins Dad","created_at":"2026-10-18T23:15+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":27417,"likes":1732,"reposts":165,"replies":140}},{"title":"中文用户提醒：长期用大陆网络连 Grok Bot 可能受限","summary":"中文网友说，长期从大陆网络跟 Grok Bot 交互，它那台美国电脑的出口地址可能被网络服务商标成中国，导致不少功能受限。","post":{"id":"2111968318353776921","url":"https://x.com/ImYanBoss/status/2111968318353776921","author":"ImYanBoss","author_name":"Yan Bo","created_at":"2026-10-19T07:51+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":16,"likes":0,"reposts":0,"replies":0},"flag":"个人分享，未核实"}]},{"id":"self_up","name":"AI 时代怎么提升自己","icon":"📚","items":[{"title":"普林斯顿博士投了 2300 份简历仍没工作","summary":"《华尔街日报》报道：一位 2024 年毕业的普林斯顿化工博士投了 2300 多份工作，至今没找到。网友争论是就业寒冬，还是他的简历和经营自己不够。","post":{"id":"2111811656279884279","url":"https://x.com/WSJ/status/2111811656279884279","author":"WSJ","author_name":"The Wall Street Journal","created_at":"2026-10-18T21:28+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":564617,"likes":2189,"reposts":460,"replies":389},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2111846806820942307","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111846806820942307"}},{"title":"靠 AI 写程序的人，要补的安全课清单","summary":"有人列了几十条「用 AI 写程序的人不懂的安全常识」，比如密码加密、钥匙别写进代码、登录防暴力破解。意思是：AI 帮你写，但出了漏洞要你担。","post":{"id":"2111332908657148356","url":"https://x.com/ghumare64/status/2111332908657148356","author":"ghumare64","author_name":"Rohit Ghumare","created_at":"2026-10-17T13:46+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":522994,"likes":5738,"reposts":675,"replies":80},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2111635497198239757","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111635497198239757"}},{"title":"谷歌工程师：让 AI 能自己检查结果","summary":"谷歌工程师奥斯马尼建议：给 AI 一个检查自己成果的办法，质量会明显提高。AI 产出比人看得快时，关键变成怎么证明它做对了。","post":{"id":"2111604705340326393","url":"https://x.com/addyosmani/status/2111604705340326393","author":"addyosmani","author_name":"Addy Osmani","created_at":"2026-10-18T07:46+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":137415,"likes":2118,"reposts":150,"replies"