":"谷歌开源 Harness²：让 AI 助手自己改进工作方法","summary":"谷歌开源工具 Harness²：不改模型本身，让 AI 助手每次做任务时自己试几种提示词和工具组合、挑最好的，还把经验带到下次。免费开源。","post":{"id":"2111753928031531232","url":"https://x.com/akshay_pachaar/status/2111753928031531232","author":"akshay_pachaar","author_name":"Akshay 🚀","created_at":"2026-10-18T17:39+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":326703,"likes":4200,"reposts":514,"replies":175},"flag":"厂商宣称","story":{"id":"2111809599519002671","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111809599519002671"}},{"title":"T3 Code：一个界面管多个 AI 编程工具","summary":"免费开源的 T3 Code 能在一个界面里指挥 Claude Code、Codex、Grok 等编程助手，电脑、网页、手机都能用。作者还说要让自己的 Grok Bot 帮忙挑社区代码。","post":{"id":"2111647825201422742","url":"https://x.com/theo/status/2111647825201422742","author":"theo","author_name":"Theo - t3.gg","created_at":"2026-10-18T10:37+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":79695,"likes":912,"reposts":4,"replies":237},"flag":"本人说法","story":{"id":"2111719852813525177","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111719852813525177"}},{"title":"免费 PDF 编辑器 RevPDF，只有 20MB","summary":"免费开源的 PDF 编辑软件 RevPDF：能改字和图片、签名、遮盖隐私、压缩、转 Word，不用注册、不联网、文件不上传。做合同、发票的可以留着。","post":{"id":"2111848429533929788","url":"https://x.com/Nozelcode/status/2111848429533929788","author":"Nozelcode","author_name":"roman","created_at":"2026-10-18T23:54+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":77704,"likes":1558,"reposts":215,"replies":42},"story":{"id":"2111868170017628183","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111868170017628183"}},{"title":"Lex Fridman 502 期访谈全部配中文","summary":"中文博主把知名播客 Lex Fridman 全部 502 期访谈，用 AI 转成文字并改写翻译成中文，做成网站，手机上可以装成 App 看。免费。","post":{"id":"2111869352266146010","url":"https://x.com/vista8/status/2111869352266146010","author":"vista8","author_name":"向阳乔木","created_at":"2026-10-19T01:17+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":13144,"likes":276,"reposts":48,"replies":29}},{"title":"XERJ：让 AI 写代码前先查成熟开源项目","summary":"中文博主推荐工具 XERJ：AI 写代码前，先帮它下载相近的开源项目、整理成可搜索资料，参考验证过的写法再动手。","post":{"id":"2111810791661781365","url":"https://x.com/lxfater/status/2111810791661781365","author":"lxfater","author_name"